tgs:LinkNote.EnergyBlindness_ArtBerman a thinkr:LinkNote,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    thinkr:aboutObject tgs:Persona.ArtBerman ;
    thinkr:aboutSubject tgs:Concept.EnergyBlindness ;
    thinkr:calculatedConfidence thinkr:ConfidenceType.Candidate ;
    thinkr:hasEvidence tgs:Evidence.EnergyBlindness_ArtBerman,
        tgs:Evidence.EnergyBlindness_ArtBerman_TGS_220 ;
    skos:scopeNote "calculatedConfidence correctly derived via scripts/compute_confidence.py (re-run 2026-07-15 after fixing a real stale-namespace bug in that script — see its own header comment). Stays Candidate: neither this LinkNote's Evidence is Curated yet, so rule 1 excludes both from the aggregation regardless of how strong the new one is. 2nd Evidence (EnergyblindnessBermanTranscript) added 2026-07-15 via the bio-intro extraction pilot — closes the original Evidence's own flagged gap ('not yet cross-checked against a specific TGS episode... establishing first use') with a direct primary-source citation. Upgrading either Evidence's own confidence to Curated is a human-review decision, not made here."@en .

